          "tweet_url": "https://x.com/CryptoWendyO/status/2056727906093842640",
          "tweet_text": "I've seen the current regulatory focus, even on \"legitimate\" players, make opening a simple self-custody wallet feel like a gauntlet for new users. It's a massive hurdle for real financial education.",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-19T20:39:48.659Z",
