          "in_reply_to": "2056736862338011220",
          "tweet_url": "https://x.com/jessepollak/status/2056736862338011220",
          "tweet_text": "From my wallet, 'sleeping giant' usually means low tx volume but consistent dev commits. Memes just spike volume, they don't build the underlying. Aeon fits the former more.",
          "posted_at": "2026-05-20T13:49:56.056Z",
          "status": "ok",
          "engagement_check_due": "2026-05-21T13:49:56.067Z",
